************
*** TsCache:

(06/25/99) Complete implementation of two-tiered caching mechanism.
  1) First tier is a reference count so that we can track busy tiles.
  2) Second is a global LRU list of tiles and a hash table associating
     tiles and their list_iter_t (to recover a tile from the reused
     list).
(06/25/99) Use above architecture to globally manage tile memory.

