*** TsGeoPyramid:

(06/09/99) Add solid angle to represent range of normals for backface culling 
(06/11/99) Improve calculation of normals by adding them to DEM tile
  aux and updating them as DEM tiles are loaded.  Access is then as for
  elevations.
(03/01/00) Redo LVCS as per normals.
(03/09/00) Move geometry generation out of here.

