*** ThreeDWidget:

(06/04/99) Implement next piece of tile popping strategy, fragments. 
(06/11/99) Improve tile backface culling by incorporating into
  GenVisibleList calculation (Since this is abit more expensive than
  we'd hoped, I've added a button to the render panel).
(06/17/99) The frustums on the View Paths option are not oriented correctly.
(06/25/99) Replace complicated and fragile timestamping system with simple
  condition variable and flags.
(07/01/99) Implement horizon culling using an estimate of where the
  horizon is from a particular eye point.  Since this should work
  better than the conservative backfacing, the default is to turn this
  on and turn off backfacing.
(07/20/99) Implement automatic calculation of near/far planes.

************
*** Texture:

(7/12/99) Reconstruct the TextureCache with the same reference count,
  LRU list scheme as TsCache.  This includes a genericizing of the
  TextureHandles and TextureBind() calls such that they are no longer
  tile-specfic.  This should allow the use of the TextureCache in the
  VRML model display.

